{"headword":"גָּנַב","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>vb.</strong> steal <strong>(</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּנַב</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܢܰܒ</span>; Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">جَنَب</span> is <em>hurt the side</em>, or <em>put aside</em>, den. from <span dir=\"rtl\">جَنْبٌ</span> <em>side</em><strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 fs. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּנָבַתּוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 21:18\" href=\"/Job.21.18\">Jb 21:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 27:20\" href=\"/Job.27.20\">27:20</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּנָבָ֫תַם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:32\" href=\"/Genesis.31.32\">Gn 31:32</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּנַבְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:30\" href=\"/Genesis.31.30\">Gn 31:30</a>; 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">וְגָנַ֑בְתִּי</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.9\">Pr 30:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּֽנְבוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:11\" href=\"/Joshua.7.11\">Jos 7:11</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:12\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.12\">2 S 21:12</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּנַבוּךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:42\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.42\">2 S 19:42</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְּנֹֽב־</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:37\" href=\"/Exodus.21.37\">Ex 21:37</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יִגְנוֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:30\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.30\">Pr 6:30</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּגְנֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:20\" href=\"/Genesis.31.20\">Gn 31:20</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתִּגְנֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:19\" href=\"/Genesis.31.19\">Gn 31:19</a> + 2 times; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּגְנֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 20:13\" href=\"/Exodus.20.13\">Ex 20:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 5:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.5.17\">Dt 5:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתִּגְנֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:26\" href=\"/Genesis.31.26\">Gn 31:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:27\" href=\"/Genesis.31.27\">27</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִ