odus 22:6\" href=\"/Exodus.22.6\">Ex 22:6</a>; <em>be brought by stealth</em> <a data-ref=\"Job 4:12\" href=\"/Job.4.12\">Jb 4:12</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">יְגֻנָּ֑ב</span>."}],"form":"Pu."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>go by stealth, steal away</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">יִתְגַּנֵּב</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.4\">2 S 19:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּתְגַּנֵּב</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.4\">2 S 19:4</a>. (Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܓܢܰܒ ܢܰܦܫܶܗ</span> <em>steal</em> oneself <em>away;</em> so <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܬܓܢܒ</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:27\" href=\"/Genesis.31.27\">Gn 31:27</a>.)"}],"form":"Hithp."}]},"rid":"BDB01880","strong_numbers":["1589"],"next_hw":"גְּנֵבָה","prev_hw":"גַּן","all_cited":true,"brackets":"first_word","root":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["1704"],"TWOT":["364"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}